  squelch-ptt                run the daemon (systemd user service does this)
  squelch-ptt --process F    DSP + transcribe file F, print result (no typing)
  squelch-ptt --probe-mic    record 1.5 s, report whether the mic delivers audio
  squelch-ptt --reset-mic    power-cycle the mic's USB port and re-probe
